{"unit_id": "liyuhan7__dsh-phone-mirror#feature-1", "repo": "liyuhan7/dsh-phone-mirror", "commit": "11a6ba3b57fc2eb2404f2b212488a154bcae1224", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-phone-mirror 的功能「侧栏投屏」：在 DSH 右侧栏注册“手机”页签并展示连接设备的画面；scrcpy 会话提供 H.264 视频和可用音频，失败时可尝试 adb 截图模式。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:1207", "lib/index.js:217", "lib/session.js:131"]}
